Subject: [PATCH] vt_ioctl: make VT_RESIZEX behave like VT_RESIZE
Message-Id: <4933b81b-9b1a-355b-df0e-9b31e8280ab9@i-love.sakura.ne.jp>
List-Id: <linux-fbdev.vger.kernel.org>
